<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>HR Management</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/app.css"></head><body class="login-page">
 <main class="login"><div class="login-intro"><a class="login-brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login">p. <span>PeopleDesk</span></a><p class="hero-tag">LESS FRICTION. MORE CONNECTION.</p><h2>Good work starts<br>with your people.</h2><p>A thoughtful workspace for the everyday moments that make a team.</p><div class="login-decoration" aria-hidden="true"><span>◈</span><span>◷</span><span>✉</span></div><small>People · Communication · Planning</small></div><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO YOUR WORKSPACE</p><h1>Hello again.</h1><p>Sign in to pick up where you left off.</p><c:if test="${not empty error}"><p class="error" role="alert"><c:out value="${error}"/></p></c:if><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="254"></label><label>Password<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="200"></label><button>Sign in</button></form></section></main><footer>PeopleDesk · A better day at work</footer></body></html>